Definitions .-In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires,-
(a)
"Act "means the Information Technology Act, 2000 (
21 of 2000
);
(b)
"Adjudicating Officer "means an adjudicating officer appointed under sub-section (1) of section 46 of the Act;
(c)
"Proforma "means a proforma appended to these rules;
(d)
words and expressions used herein and not defined but defined in the Act shall have the meaning respectively assigned
to them in the Act.
